<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/lu_43204eb005113090db3476895a76cc14f70698fd23b8582928d6dd3b8f43e10b_n0044/tu_0005> <http://digistrucmed.org/verbatimText> "Sotalol\nAntiarrhythmic (Class III)\nB\nYes\nYes b\nBradycardia and hypoglycaemia\nAnimal data:\n• no teratogenic potential in rats (9× MRHD) and rabbits (7× MRHD)\n• rabbits: a high dose of sotalol hydrochloride (6× MRHD) produced a slight increase in foetal death, likely due to maternal toxicity\n• rats (18× MRHD): increased number of early resorptions" .
